{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQA3uLzKhTU3ow3b2PCT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SjAL4aop6ZyuMoJSEFHnFB","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-023-fiAhNy/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>通勤情况调查问卷</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"measure-prose\">\n      <h1>通勤情况调查问卷</h1>\n      <p>我们想了解大家每天上下班路上花多少时间、用什么交通方式，以便为灵活办公和交通补贴政策提供参考。</p>\n      <p>共 6 道题，大约需要 2 分钟。问卷匿名填写，不收集姓名和联系方式。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"progress\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"progress-label\">已完成 <span id=\"answered\">0</span> / 6 题</div>\n      <div class=\"progress-bar\"><span id=\"bar\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"survey\" novalidate>\n      <fieldset data-q=\"mode\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">1.</span>你最主要的通勤交通方式是？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选，选路程中占用时间最长的一种。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"地铁 / 轻轨\">地铁 / 轻轨</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"公交车\">公交车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"自驾\">自驾</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"网约车 / 出租车\">网约车 / 出租车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"电动车 / 摩托车\">电动车 / 摩托车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"自行车 / 共享单车\">自行车 / 共享单车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"步行\">步行</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"班车\">班车</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"time\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">2.</span>单程通勤一般需要多长时间？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选，从出门到抵达工位计算。</p>\n        <div class=\"options\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"15 分钟以内\">15 分钟以内</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"15–30 分钟\">15–30 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"30–45 分钟\">30–45 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"45–60 分钟\">45–60 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"60–90 分钟\">60–90 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"90 分钟以上\">90 分钟以上</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"days\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">3.</span>你每周大约有几天需要到办公地点？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"1 天及以下\">1 天及以下</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"2–3 天\">2–3 天</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"4 天\">4 天</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"5 天及以上\">5 天及以上</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"extra\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">4.</span>通勤途中你还会换乘或用到哪些方式？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">多选；不换乘就选“无需换乘”。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"地铁 / 轻轨\">地铁 / 轻轨</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"公交车\">公交车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"共享单车\">共享单车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"网约车 / 出租车\">网约车 / 出租车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"步行 10 分钟以上\">步行 10 分钟以上</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"无需换乘\" data-exclusive>无需换乘</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"rating\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">5.</span>你对目前的通勤体验满意吗？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">1 分表示非常不满意，5 分表示非常满意。</p>\n        <div class=\"scale\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1\">1</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"2\">2</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"3\">3</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"4\">4</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"5\">5</label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scale-ends\"><span>非常不满意</span><span>非常满意</span></div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"note\">\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">6.</span>关于通勤，你最希望改善的是什么？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">选填，比如错峰上班、班车线路、停车位或补贴。</p>\n        <textarea name=\"note\" maxlength=\"300\" placeholder=\"写下你的想法\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"count\"><span id=\"noteCount\">0</span> / 300</div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"submit\">提交问卷</button>\n        <span id=\"formError\" class=\"error-msg\" hidden></span>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n\n    <section id=\"done\" class=\"done\" hidden>\n      <h2>提交成功，谢谢你的参与！</h2>\n      <p>以下是你填写的内容：</p>\n      <dl id=\"summary\"></dl>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ghost\" id=\"again\">重新填写</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var form = document.getElementById('survey');\n      var sets = Array.prototype.slice.call(form.querySelectorAll('fieldset'));\n      var note = form.elements.note;\n      var labels = {\n        mode: '主要交通方式',\n        time: '单程通勤时间',\n        days: '每周到岗天数',\n        extra: '换乘或辅助方式',\n        rating: '通勤满意度',\n        note: '希望改善的地方'\n      };\n\n      function values(name) {\n        var el = form.elements[name];\n        if (el.tagName === 'TEXTAREA') return el.value.trim() ? [el.value.trim()] : [];\n        return Array.prototype.filter.call(form.querySelectorAll('[name=\"' + name + '\"]'), function (i) {\n          return i.checked;\n        }).map(function (i) { return i.value; });\n      }\n\n      function updateProgress() {\n        var n = sets.filter(function (fs) { return values(fs.dataset.q).length > 0; }).length;\n        document.getElementById('answered').textContent = n;\n        document.getElementById('bar').style.width = (n / sets.length * 100) + '%';\n      }\n\n      form.addEventListener('change', function (e) {\n        var t = e.target;\n        // “无需换乘”与其他选项互斥\n        if (t.name === 'extra' && t.checked) {\n          form.querySelectorAll('[name=\"extra\"]').forEach(function (i) {\n            if (i !== t && (t.hasAttribute('data-exclusive') || i.hasAttribute('data-exclusive'))) i.checked = false;\n          });\n        }\n        var fs = t.closest('fieldset');\n        if (fs) {\n          fs.classList.remove('invalid');\n          var msg = fs.querySelector('.error-msg');\n          if (msg) msg.remove();\n        }\n        updateProgress();\n      });\n\n      note.addEventListener('input', function () {\n        document.getElementById('noteCount').textContent = note.value.length;\n        updateProgress();\n      });\n\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        var missing = [];\n        sets.forEach(function (fs) {\n          var old = fs.querySelector('.error-msg');\n          if (old) old.remove();\n          if (fs.hasAttribute('data-required') && values(fs.dataset.q).length === 0) {\n            missing.push(fs);\n            fs.classList.add('invalid');\n            var p = document.createElement('p');\n            p.className = 'error-msg';\n            p.textContent = '这道题还没有作答。';\n            fs.appendChild(p);\n          }\n        });\n        var err = document.getElementById('formError');\n        if (missing.length) {\n          err.textContent = '还有 ' + missing.length + ' 道必答题没有完成。';\n          err.hidden = false;\n          missing[0].scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n          return;\n        }\n        err.hidden = true;\n\n        var dl = document.getElementById('summary');\n        dl.innerHTML = '';\n        sets.forEach(function (fs) {\n          var q = fs.dataset.q;\n          var v = values(q);\n          var dt = document.createElement('dt');\n          var dd = document.createElement('dd');\n          dt.textContent = labels[q];\n          if (q === 'rating') dd.textContent = v[0] + ' 分（满分 5 分）';\n          else dd.textContent = v.length ? v.join('、') : '未填写';\n          dl.appendChild(dt);\n          dl.appendChild(dd);\n        });\n        form.hidden = true;\n        document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = true;\n        document.getElementById('done').hidden = false;\n        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('again').addEventListener('click', function () {\n        form.reset();\n        document.getElementById('noteCount').textContent = '0';\n        updateProgress();\n        document.getElementById('done').hidden = true;\n        document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = false;\n        form.hidden = false;\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2419,"cache_read_input_tokens":46991,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2419},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"114b3388-cb8d-49fb-91ff-8b97c33bef2a","uuid":"7ac78225-aaad-4388-a0fe-5530e649995e","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:42:43.073Z","request_id":"req_011CgQA3u5rqWVd9GNdXWpRg","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01SjAL4aop6ZyuMoJSEFHnFB":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-023-fiAhNy/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>通勤情况调查问卷</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"measure-prose\">\n      <h1>通勤情况调查问卷</h1>\n      <p>我们想了解大家每天上下班路上花多少时间、用什么交通方式，以便为灵活办公和交通补贴政策提供参考。</p>\n      <p>共 6 道题，大约需要 2 分钟。问卷匿名填写，不收集姓名和联系方式。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"progress\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"progress-label\">已完成 <span id=\"answered\">0</span> / 6 题</div>\n      <div class=\"progress-bar\"><span id=\"bar\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"survey\" novalidate>\n      <fieldset data-q=\"mode\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">1.</span>你最主要的通勤交通方式是？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选，选路程中占用时间最长的一种。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"地铁 / 轻轨\">地铁 / 轻轨</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"公交车\">公交车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"自驾\">自驾</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"网约车 / 出租车\">网约车 / 出租车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"电动车 / 摩托车\">电动车 / 摩托车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"自行车 / 共享单车\">自行车 / 共享单车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"步行\">步行</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"班车\">班车</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"time\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">2.</span>单程通勤一般需要多长时间？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选，从出门到抵达工位计算。</p>\n        <div class=\"options\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"15 分钟以内\">15 分钟以内</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"15–30 分钟\">15–30 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"30–45 分钟\">30–45 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"45–60 分钟\">45–60 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"60–90 分钟\">60–90 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"90 分钟以上\">90 分钟以上</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"days\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">3.</span>你每周大约有几天需要到办公地点？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"1 天及以下\">1 天及以下</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"2–3 天\">2–3 天</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"4 天\">4 天</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"5 天及以上\">5 天及以上</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"extra\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">4.</span>通勤途中你还会换乘或用到哪些方式？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">多选；不换乘就选“无需换乘”。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"地铁 / 轻轨\">地铁 / 轻轨</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"公交车\">公交车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"共享单车\">共享单车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"网约车 / 出租车\">网约车 / 出租车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"步行 10 分钟以上\">步行 10 分钟以上</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"无需换乘\" data-exclusive>无需换乘</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"rating\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">5.</span>你对目前的通勤体验满意吗？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">1 分表示非常不满意，5 分表示非常满意。</p>\n        <div class=\"scale\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1\">1</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"2\">2</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"3\">3</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"4\">4</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"5\">5</label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scale-ends\"><span>非常不满意</span><span>非常满意</span></div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"note\">\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">6.</span>关于通勤，你最希望改善的是什么？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">选填，比如错峰上班、班车线路、停车位或补贴。</p>\n        <textarea name=\"note\" maxlength=\"300\" placeholder=\"写下你的想法\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"count\"><span id=\"noteCount\">0</span> / 300</div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"submit\">提交问卷</button>\n        <span id=\"formError\" class=\"error-msg\" hidden></span>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n\n    <section id=\"done\" class=\"done\" hidden>\n      <h2>提交成功，谢谢你的参与！</h2>\n      <p>以下是你填写的内容：</p>\n      <dl id=\"summary\"></dl>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ghost\" id=\"again\">重新填写</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var form = document.getElementById('survey');\n      var sets = Array.prototype.slice.call(form.querySelectorAll('fieldset'));\n      var note = form.elements.note;\n      var labels = {\n        mode: '主要交通方式',\n        time: '单程通勤时间',\n        days: '每周到岗天数',\n        extra: '换乘或辅助方式',\n        rating: '通勤满意度',\n        note: '希望改善的地方'\n      };\n\n      function values(name) {\n        var el = form.elements[name];\n        if (el.tagName === 'TEXTAREA') return el.value.trim() ? [el.value.trim()] : [];\n        return Array.prototype.filter.call(form.querySelectorAll('[name=\"' + name + '\"]'), function (i) {\n          return i.checked;\n        }).map(function (i) { return i.value; });\n      }\n\n      function updateProgress() {\n        var n = sets.filter(function (fs) { return values(fs.dataset.q).length > 0; }).length;\n        document.getElementById('answered').textContent = n;\n        document.getElementById('bar').style.width = (n / sets.length * 100) + '%';\n      }\n\n      form.addEventListener('change', function (e) {\n        var t = e.target;\n        // “无需换乘”与其他选项互斥\n        if (t.name === 'extra' && t.checked) {\n          form.querySelectorAll('[name=\"extra\"]').forEach(function (i) {\n            if (i !== t && (t.hasAttribute('data-exclusive') || i.hasAttribute('data-exclusive'))) i.checked = false;\n          });\n        }\n        var fs = t.closest('fieldset');\n        if (fs) {\n          fs.classList.remove('invalid');\n          var msg = fs.querySelector('.error-msg');\n          if (msg) msg.remove();\n        }\n        updateProgress();\n      });\n\n      note.addEventListener('input', function () {\n        document.getElementById('noteCount').textContent = note.value.length;\n        updateProgress();\n      });\n\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        var missing = [];\n        sets.forEach(function (fs) {\n          var old = fs.querySelector('.error-msg');\n          if (old) old.remove();\n          if (fs.hasAttribute('data-required') && values(fs.dataset.q).length === 0) {\n            missing.push(fs);\n            fs.classList.add('invalid');\n            var p = document.createElement('p');\n            p.className = 'error-msg';\n            p.textContent = '这道题还没有作答。';\n            fs.appendChild(p);\n          }\n        });\n        var err = document.getElementById('formError');\n        if (missing.length) {\n          err.textContent = '还有 ' + missing.length + ' 道必答题没有完成。';\n          err.hidden = false;\n          missing[0].scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n          return;\n        }\n        err.hidden = true;\n\n        var dl = document.getElementById('summary');\n        dl.innerHTML = '';\n        sets.forEach(function (fs) {\n          var q = fs.dataset.q;\n          var v = values(q);\n          var dt = document.createElement('dt');\n          var dd = document.createElement('dd');\n          dt.textContent = labels[q];\n          if (q === 'rating') dd.textContent = v[0] + ' 分（满分 5 分）';\n          else dd.textContent = v.length ? v.join('、') : '未填写';\n          dl.appendChild(dt);\n          dl.appendChild(dd);\n        });\n        form.hidden = true;\n        document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = true;\n        document.getElementById('done').hidden = false;\n        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('again').addEventListener('click', function () {\n        form.reset();\n        document.getElementById('noteCount').textContent = '0';\n        updateProgress();\n        document.getElementById('done').hidden = true;\n        document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = false;\n        form.hidden = false;\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SjAL4aop6ZyuMoJSEFHnFB","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-023-fiAhNy/index.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"114b3388-cb8d-49fb-91ff-8b97c33bef2a","uuid":"0005bc1a-5e02-4e00-a956-10221caab37a","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:42:43.105Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-023-fiAhNy/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>通勤情况调查问卷</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"wrap\">\n    <header class=\"measure-prose\">\n      <h1>通勤情况调查问卷</h1>\n      <p>我们想了解大家每天上下班路上花多少时间、用什么交通方式，以便为灵活办公和交通补贴政策提供参考。</p>\n      <p>共 6 道题，大约需要 2 分钟。问卷匿名填写，不收集姓名和联系方式。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"progress\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n      <div class=\"progress-label\">已完成 <span id=\"answered\">0</span> / 6 题</div>\n      <div class=\"progress-bar\"><span id=\"bar\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <form id=\"survey\" novalidate>\n      <fieldset data-q=\"mode\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">1.</span>你最主要的通勤交通方式是？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选，选路程中占用时间最长的一种。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"地铁 / 轻轨\">地铁 / 轻轨</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"公交车\">公交车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"自驾\">自驾</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"网约车 / 出租车\">网约车 / 出租车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"电动车 / 摩托车\">电动车 / 摩托车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"自行车 / 共享单车\">自行车 / 共享单车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"步行\">步行</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" value=\"班车\">班车</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"time\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">2.</span>单程通勤一般需要多长时间？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选，从出门到抵达工位计算。</p>\n        <div class=\"options\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"15 分钟以内\">15 分钟以内</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"15–30 分钟\">15–30 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"30–45 分钟\">30–45 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"45–60 分钟\">45–60 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"60–90 分钟\">60–90 分钟</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"time\" value=\"90 分钟以上\">90 分钟以上</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"days\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">3.</span>你每周大约有几天需要到办公地点？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">单选。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"1 天及以下\">1 天及以下</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"2–3 天\">2–3 天</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"4 天\">4 天</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"days\" value=\"5 天及以上\">5 天及以上</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"extra\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">4.</span>通勤途中你还会换乘或用到哪些方式？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">多选；不换乘就选“无需换乘”。</p>\n        <div class=\"options two\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"地铁 / 轻轨\">地铁 / 轻轨</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"公交车\">公交车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"共享单车\">共享单车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"网约车 / 出租车\">网约车 / 出租车</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"步行 10 分钟以上\">步行 10 分钟以上</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"extra\" value=\"无需换乘\" data-exclusive>无需换乘</label>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"rating\" data-required>\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">5.</span>你对目前的通勤体验满意吗？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">1 分表示非常不满意，5 分表示非常满意。</p>\n        <div class=\"scale\">\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1\">1</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"2\">2</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"3\">3</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"4\">4</label>\n          <label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"rating\" value=\"5\">5</label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"scale-ends\"><span>非常不满意</span><span>非常满意</span></div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset data-q=\"note\">\n        <legend><span class=\"no\">6.</span>关于通勤，你最希望改善的是什么？</legend>\n        <p class=\"hint\">选填，比如错峰上班、班车线路、停车位或补贴。</p>\n        <textarea name=\"note\" maxlength=\"300\" placeholder=\"写下你的想法\"></textarea>\n        <div class=\"count\"><span id=\"noteCount\">0</span> / 300</div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"submit\">提交问卷</button>\n        <span id=\"formError\" class=\"error-msg\" hidden></span>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n\n    <section id=\"done\" class=\"done\" hidden>\n      <h2>提交成功，谢谢你的参与！</h2>\n      <p>以下是你填写的内容：</p>\n      <dl id=\"summary\"></dl>\n      <div class=\"actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"ghost\" id=\"again\">重新填写</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var form = document.getElementById('survey');\n      var sets = Array.prototype.slice.call(form.querySelectorAll('fieldset'));\n      var note = form.elements.note;\n      var labels = {\n        mode: '主要交通方式',\n        time: '单程通勤时间',\n        days: '每周到岗天数',\n        extra: '换乘或辅助方式',\n        rating: '通勤满意度',\n        note: '希望改善的地方'\n      };\n\n      function values(name) {\n        var el = form.elements[name];\n        if (el.tagName === 'TEXTAREA') return el.value.trim() ? [el.value.trim()] : [];\n        return Array.prototype.filter.call(form.querySelectorAll('[name=\"' + name + '\"]'), function (i) {\n          return i.checked;\n        }).map(function (i) { return i.value; });\n      }\n\n      function updateProgress() {\n        var n = sets.filter(function (fs) { return values(fs.dataset.q).length > 0; }).length;\n        document.getElementById('answered').textContent = n;\n        document.getElementById('bar').style.width = (n / sets.length * 100) + '%';\n      }\n\n      form.addEventListener('change', function (e) {\n        var t = e.target;\n        // “无需换乘”与其他选项互斥\n        if (t.name === 'extra' && t.checked) {\n          form.querySelectorAll('[name=\"extra\"]').forEach(function (i) {\n            if (i !== t && (t.hasAttribute('data-exclusive') || i.hasAttribute('data-exclusive'))) i.checked = false;\n          });\n        }\n        var fs = t.closest('fieldset');\n        if (fs) {\n          fs.classList.remove('invalid');\n          var msg = fs.querySelector('.error-msg');\n          if (msg) msg.remove();\n        }\n        updateProgress();\n      });\n\n      note.addEventListener('input', function () {\n        document.getElementById('noteCount').textContent = note.value.length;\n        updateProgress();\n      });\n\n      form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        var missing = [];\n        sets.forEach(function (fs) {\n          var old = fs.querySelector('.error-msg');\n          if (old) old.remove();\n          if (fs.hasAttribute('data-required') && values(fs.dataset.q).length === 0) {\n            missing.push(fs);\n            fs.classList.add('invalid');\n            var p = document.createElement('p');\n            p.className = 'error-msg';\n            p.textContent = '这道题还没有作答。';\n            fs.appendChild(p);\n          }\n        });\n        var err = document.getElementById('formError');\n        if (missing.length) {\n          err.textContent = '还有 ' + missing.length + ' 道必答题没有完成。';\n          err.hidden = false;\n          missing[0].scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n          return;\n        }\n        err.hidden = true;\n\n        var dl = document.getElementById('summary');\n        dl.innerHTML = '';\n        sets.forEach(function (fs) {\n          var q = fs.dataset.q;\n          var v = values(q);\n          var dt = document.createElement('dt');\n          var dd = document.createElement('dd');\n          dt.textContent = labels[q];\n          if (q === 'rating') dd.textContent = v[0] + ' 分（满分 5 分）';\n          else dd.textContent = v.length ? v.join('、') : '未填写';\n          dl.appendChild(dt);\n          dl.appendChild(dd);\n        });\n        form.hidden = true;\n        document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = true;\n        document.getElementById('done').hidden = false;\n        window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('again').addEventListener('click', function () {\n        form.reset();\n        document.getElementById('noteCount').textContent = '0';\n        updateProgress();\n        document.getElementById('done').hidden = true;\n        document.querySelector('.progress').hidden = false;\n        form.hidden = false;\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01SjAL4aop6ZyuMoJSEFHnFB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
